{"id":"ncfd37b3000","headline":"Türkiye and Azerbaijan sign defense industry contracts worth over $500 million","summary":"Türkiye and Azerbaijan signed supply contracts and a memorandum of understanding in the defense industry, according to Türkiye's Defense Industry Minister Haluk Görgün. The deals are reported at over $500 million.","why":"Defense procurement is a steady source of revenue for domestic arms makers and shapes regional security spending. Contracts of this size can affect the defense industry and bilateral trade.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"trade","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Ankara","country":"Turkey","lat":39.93,"lon":32.86,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Apa.az","url":"https://en.apa.az/military/turkiye-and-azerbaijan-sign-defense-industry-contracts-worth-over-500-million-527379"},"sources":[{"name":"Apa.az","url":"https://en.apa.az/military/turkiye-and-azerbaijan-sign-defense-industry-contracts-worth-over-500-million-527379"}],"published_at":"2026-09-30T14:01:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"c4578fdc48b4aaff","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:12Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-30T14:01:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-30T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AJ","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-5180626.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"Endzeiter","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/the-european-parliament-in-strasbourg-5180626/"}}